            <ArticleTitle>Acceleration of diffusion in ethylammonium nitrate ionic liquid confined between parallel glass plates.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>25853-25858</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cp01772c</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Diffusion of EAN confined between polar glass plates separated by a few micrometers is higher by a factor of ca. 2 as compared to bulk values. Formation of a new phase, different to the bulk, was suggested.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
